Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.97,0:00:39.83,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1490,872,1510,886,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.06,0:01:36.63,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,I can't believe there was a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.63,0:01:39.08,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,His body is incredibly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:41.66,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Gatlantis ship was blown to pieces, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.42,0:01:45.78,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,There are signs of artificial modification in its DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.78,0:01:49.10,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Maybe he's not a simple humanoid, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:52.96,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,An artificial life-form, like a synthetic soldier ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:57.03,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Did you see them while you were\N aboard the Yamato, Miss Niimi ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:01:58.53,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,I saw them, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.53,0:02:00.95,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,Hold on. I'll get some documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:12.23,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx148\fscy113\pos(962,1036)}Garmillas Empire Earth Embassy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.71,0:02:14.63,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,It's confirmed, Ambassador !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:17.94,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,A surviving Gatlantis soldier is being \Nheld at an Earth Force research facility !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.38,0:02:21.18,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,Make them stop at once !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:24.28,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Pressure's rising inside the capsule !\N It's dangerous !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:25.43,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What's going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:27.28,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It's boiling ! Release the valve !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.28,0:02:28.31,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,There's no time !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:58.79,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,People around the whole world, as the\N first president of the Earth Federation...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:03:05.76,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,{konnichi}...I hereby declare the completion\N of the latest Andromeda class ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:07.98,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(968,816)}Earth Federation Defense Force Adromeda Class
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:07.98,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(352,888)}Ship 3 - Apollo Norm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:07.98,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(786,896)}Ship 4 - Achilles
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:07.98,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(1196,892)}Ship 2 - Aldebaran
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:07.98,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(1600,890)}Ship 5 - Antares
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:16.30,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,{uchuu}The alliance between Earth and Garmillas is a strength that will bring peace to the universe and maintain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:22.20,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,{sono}As the symbol of assuming such a heavy responsibility, ship No.1 has already...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:25.63,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us about the survivor ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:38.23,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,Gatlantis soldiers will self-destruct unless a certain treatment is made to the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:40.63,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,That's how they're created.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:42.75,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,If you had informed us...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:50.50,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,With all due respect, your disclosure\N of such important information now is like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.94,0:03:53.23,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,Are you blaming us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:56.08,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,If you had told us about it before the joint operation...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:04:01.78,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,We had unfortunate misunderstandings in \Nthe past, but Earth and Garmillas are now allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:05.12,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,I believe we're equal partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:18.22,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Earth's current population is 1/3 of its peak time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:22.03,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{desler}Even if Garmillas is in turmoil \Nafter the collapse of the Desler regime...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:26.18,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,{Garmillas}...you could easily invade us if you were so inclined.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:29.78,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Obviously, that shouldn't happen, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:34.03,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,I know it's paranoia because\N we have an equivalent word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:38.47,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,My advice is that you're playing with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:43.82,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,You broke a promise with Iscandar,\N which is what saved you.{lifesaver.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:49.38,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Right. That was just a verbal agreement{promise} that\N the captain of a spaceship made on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.38,0:04:52.98,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,It wasn't a treaty or the \Nwish of the Earth government.{side.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:35.32,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,These are ?{And these ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:37.52,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,The former crew of the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:45.33,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,They could have heard the voice of Teresa, \Nalthough I have no confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.33,0:05:46.33,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,They did ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.78,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,The Earth government is aware of it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:53.60,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,I want to talk to them in person before the information gets leaked from the Garmillas home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:59.44,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,He's the earthling who attempted to stop \Nthat huge Gatlantis battleship with a tiny ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:04.23,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,If Telezart is involved, the matter is very serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.23,0:06:07.39,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,Maybe he can...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:04.03,Karaoke Translation op,BAREL,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx120\fscy96\pos(968,922)}Grand Court of Inquiry{Bench of the Court}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:17.86,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,“Thank you for your service.”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:26.26,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,They chewed you out ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:31.46,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Quite a lot. "Do you understand the\N implications of your actions ?" they asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:34.32,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,"I saved Earth, so what ?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:36.15,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Nah, I couldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.15,0:06:39.39,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Go ahead and say it. Nobody is listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:43.88,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai Susumu saved Earth !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.11,0:06:48.80,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,You'd better thank him ! This's the second time !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:48.80,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Hey !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.42,0:06:51.84,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Mori Yuki was worried !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:02.83,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,My apologies.\N Kodai Susumu deeply regrets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:23.38,Karaoke Translation op,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\a5\frz345\move(690,10,540,106,13,3559)}Planned Power Outage\NLifted for the Area\Nof Expansion
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.43,0:07:27.38,yamato,GRAFFITI,0,0,0,,{\c&H3031A9&\3c&H252527&\fscx226\fscy190\pos(1194,632)\frz334}Gami Get the hell out!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:32.42,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Amazing, isn't it ? \NI feel like I'm back on old Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:33.90,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Do you remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:39.38,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:43.75,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,What about you ? Are you alright ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:50.36,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Any anxiety about having a wife\N with only four years of memories ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:54.79,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,The memories of the past \Nfour years are all that we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:08:01.64,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,The voyage to Iscandar and the\N remaining three years weren't so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.47,0:08:04.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It's not easy even today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:06.63,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,But we're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.12,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.96,0:08:12.63,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Let's just look ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:14.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We will be happy for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:17.47,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It's the duty of those who have survived...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.47,0:08:18.28,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.55,0:08:25.98,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm already happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:42.59,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Captain Okita, look at those colorful cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.63,0:08:51.20,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,The battle against Garmillas feels like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:53.28,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Drink up, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.08,0:08:57.28,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Today is your third anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:06.99,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Earth has changed, building large cities and a \Nnumber of huge battleships with wave motion guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:12.46,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,I'm fine with restoration, \Nbut I must doubt its direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:29.98,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Nobody looks back at the Yamato, \Nwhich housed the Cosmo Reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:37.68,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Okita, looks like we're the only\N ones who remember that battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:39.80,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Dr. Sado.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.63,0:09:47.06,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,You're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:52.44,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Hey !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:55.64,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,What took you so long ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:56.86,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.26,0:09:57.91,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.91,0:09:59.84,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Shima, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:02.13,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,I heard you put on a flashy show again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:04.72,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,The entire transport fleet is buzzing about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:09.43,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,All hands, line up !{stand up in lines.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:14.60,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Captain, all those on Earth are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:20.52,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,They're committed to restoring Earth\N in each of their fields, so please rest{feel} easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:26.08,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Give a salute to the soul of Okita Juzo,\N the great captain of the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:51.66,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.60,0:10:57.38,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...I'm sorry for making you assume all the responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:10:58.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.34,0:11:03.92,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I'm concerned about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:10.24,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Immediately after that incident, there was a\N communication failure throughout the Solar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:11.40,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:13.64,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We don't know what caused it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.79,0:11:19.26,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai, who did you see at that moment ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.06,0:11:23.40,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Kodai, get on board the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.59,0:11:30.64,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,It was my deceased father,\N for the first time in ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:32.28,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,He was a man of few words as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.11,0:11:36.08,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,I saw someone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:37.63,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,I saw my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:41.35,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,He clearly urged me to\N get on board the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:42.79,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,I did, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.79,0:11:43.50,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.35,0:11:46.63,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What are the odds ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.63,0:11:49.74,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It must have targeted the former Yamato crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:55.54,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,A lot of people saw a similar\N vision at the exact same moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:58.43,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...and the military seems to have\N begun its own investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.43,0:11:59.28,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,The military has ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:05.28,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,A fleet of ships with wave motion guns, \Nand unrealistic recovery plans...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:10.15,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,What the Yamato brought back wasn't\N meant to build this kind of Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.51,0:12:17.48,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,It feels like the Yamato became pessimistic \Nabout the future of Earth and called upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:21.99,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,The Yamato did...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:26.00,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai, who was in your vision ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.15,0:12:30.31,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I didn't see anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:38.23,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's the Andromeda !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:40.34,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,That's the first ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.88,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Screw you !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:14.44,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I have something I want both of you to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:17.03,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What's this comet-like object ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:18.43,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's an unknown quasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:23.13,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,After making spatial corrections, we\N discovered that it's approaching Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.13,0:13:25.72,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...at near light-speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:32.23,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's a concern, but it's not expected to reach the\N Earth sector until tens of thousands of years from now.{later.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:37.08,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{soreyori}The bigger problem is the energy \Nwave which made us see that vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:41.34,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{kono}It became clear that the wave was emitted\N from almost the same direction as this quasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:45.38,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{akiraka}It was clearly directed at Earth\N with extreme directional accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:51.64,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It somehow influenced our consciousness\Nand made us see people from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.67,0:13:52.46,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:57.23,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The thing is, the Yamato's recorder had a log...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.23,0:14:00.07,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...and I was able to sneak it \Nout before the military took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:02.12,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I'm going to extract the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.63,0:14:09.53,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.88,0:14:11.31,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The data is going out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.78,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Warriors of a distant planet....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:21.06,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}...all of you and everything else...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.63,0:14:33.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You saw her, didn't you, Shima ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:37.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It was a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:38.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,A prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:40.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,She was asking for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.14,0:14:43.71,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You saw her, right, Sanada ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:48.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We have to go to this location.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:49.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:50.58,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Watch it !{ your step !}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.13,0:14:52.66,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Kodai, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:55.44,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I agree with Kodai's opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:15:03.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I don't have any reason, but she made\N us see that vision, which shook our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.94,0:15:10.04,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We have been called upon...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.55,0:15:17.63,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...by an unknown entity in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.63,0:15:20.26,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Our hearts understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:27.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We should go...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.19,0:15:31.74,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...regardless of who the person is, or wherever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:35.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Captain Okita must have wanted to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:40.86,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,If someone in the universe needs our help, we must...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:41.71,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:58.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Shima, don't you see ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.48,0:16:01.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}A sailor must not abandon\N those who are in need of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:04.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Your father would say the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:08.28,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}The reason isn't strong enough to take any action.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:11.31,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Only you can pilot the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:21.07,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Several hundred former crewmen of the\N Yamato have received the same message.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:25.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}The military won't be able to ignore it.\N If we bring this to them...{work on them...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:29.31,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}If the military was that flexible,\N I wouldn't have quit the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.34,0:16:33.88,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}You're not alone anymore, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:36.88,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Think about Miss Mori, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:41.48,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H252527&\fscx137\fscy116\pos(958,928)}Former Far East Command HQ
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:38.78,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,You've been under surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:42.38,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,Along with the rest of the Yamato crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:43.64,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Under surveillance ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:45.10,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,You should have some idea why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:48.71,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.14,0:17:54.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,A Garmillan...{ (or Gamilan?)}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.80,0:18:02.78,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,This humidity is terrible. \NIn a place like this, you earthlings are so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:09.80,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to forget about the past. The war also took many lives on our end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.98,0:18:16.28,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,But Garmillas owes a lot to the Yamato,\N and I want to pay off that debt.{make it even.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:22.62,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,I invite you to the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:23.95,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,The Moon ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:26.56,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,To the Garmillas Embassy on the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:33.53,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H252527&\fscx120\fscy96\pos(948,798)}Earth Federation Defense Force's Next Primary Fighter
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:33.53,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H252527&\fscx137\fscy132\pos(946,850)}Cosmo Tiger II
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.73,0:18:39.83,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H252527&\fscx150\fscy113\pos(962,854)}Prototype Fighter\NCosmo Tiger I
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:33.83,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Guys, you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:37.63,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...only fifteen seconds left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.63,0:18:39.83,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Can't you even leave a scratch ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.35,0:18:42.74,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}You're wasting a superior new fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:44.33,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Five...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:45.33,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...four...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:46.33,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...three...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.33,0:18:47.34,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...two...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:50.63,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.63,0:18:52.95,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Tsurumi, you're dead again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:53.68,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Dammit !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:01.55,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,You can't be so pathetic\N in front of Instructor Kato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:07.28,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Instructor Yamamoto's so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.28,0:19:11.03,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,This is the third time this month that \NInstructor Kato has had to take a leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.03,0:19:13.62,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,His son's illness is that bad ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:16.04,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It's because of the space radiation sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.04,0:19:17.04,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It's congenital ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.04,0:19:17.75,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:20.46,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Makoto thinks it's her fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.26,0:19:24.63,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,A sanatorium on the Moon \Ncan slow down the progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.63,0:19:26.84,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:41.58,Karaoke Translation op,SCREEN,0,0,0,,{\fscx193\fscy166\c&H84C185&\pos(1260,478)\frz4.88}Susumu Kodai
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:43.38,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Kodai...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:47.68,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,{\i1}When the freighter reaches Moon orbit...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.68,0:19:52.82,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,{\i1}...you descend to the Moon's surface\N along with the purged cargo boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.35,0:20:04.18,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Remember, the Embassy is guarded with a \Nnumber of unmanned anti-terrorism weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:09.13,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meet{See} Ambassador Barrel.{Darrel.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:12.23,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,You'll learn{know} the truth about your vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:16.68,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,{\i1}This concerns the future of both Earth and Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:20.14,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the first step.\NDon't let {your }carelessness kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:21.63,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Klaus Keyman...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:23.40,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Liaison my ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:27.46,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Right now, I must move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.88,0:20:56.67,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}This is Yamamoto Akira of the Cosmo\N Tiger Team, hailing the Moon Command HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.67,0:20:59.94,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}I accidentally encroached on \NGarmillas Embassy airspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:03.39,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Tell them that it was accidental, and issue an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:10.51,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:55.43,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Your Majesty Zorder, we've identified\N the destination of Teresa's cosmo wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.06,0:22:00.16,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,It's a very remote planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.96,0:22:06.90,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,One of our vanguard fleet's\N vessels went missing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.39,0:22:11.96,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,I presume it's the home planet of those\N who've formed an alliance with Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.59,0:22:15.02,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Earth, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.78,0:22:21.91,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,His Majesty has made a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.51,0:22:25.04,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Gatlantis Empire, move forward !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.38,0:22:45.13,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\pos(214,870)\3c&H000000&}Episode 02
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.38,0:22:45.13,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\fscx118\fscy108\3c&H000000&\pos(528,1046)}Tense Infiltration into the Embassy on the Moon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:15.96,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Sono hito no yasashisa ga hana ni masaru nara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:15.96,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}If that person's gentleness exceeds that of the flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.39,0:23:29.56,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\i1}Sono hito no utsukushisa ga hoshi ni masaru nara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.39,0:23:29.56,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}If that person's beauty exceeds that of the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.11,0:23:37.52,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kimi wa te wo hirogete mamoru ga ii
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.11,0:23:37.52,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}You had better open your arms and offer protection
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.91,0:23:44.46,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Karada wo nagedasu neuchi ga aru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.91,0:23:44.46,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It's worth risking your life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.94,0:23:57.86,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Hitori hitori ga omou koto wa ai suru hito no tame dake de ii
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.94,0:23:57.86,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Each of you had better think about the person you love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.63,0:24:12.52,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kimi ni hanasu koto ga aru toshitara ima wa sore dake kamo shirenai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.63,0:24:12.52,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}If there's anything I can say, perhaps that's all for now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.52,0:24:18.98,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ima wa saraba to iwasenai de kure
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.52,0:24:18.98,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Don't make me say goodbye for now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.22,0:24:26.60,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ima wa saraba to iwasenai de kure
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.22,0:24:26.60,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Don't make me say goodbye for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:12.33,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(1194,586)}Kodai Susumu:\NMori Yuki:\NShima Daisuke:\NSanada Shiro:\NNanbu Yasuo:\NAihara Yoshikazu\NTokugawa Hikozaemon:\NSado Sakezo:\NOhta Kenjiro:\NYamamoto Akira:\NNiimi Kaoru:\NTsurumi Jiro:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:12.33,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1244,106)}Ono Daisuke\NKuwashima Houko\NSuzumura Kenichi \NOtsuka Hochu\NAkabane Kenji \NKokubun Masato\NMugihito\NChiba Shigeru\NChiba Yuki\NTanaka Rie\NHisakawa Aya\NKawamoto Keiji
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:19.33,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(1194,586)}Okita Juzo:\NTodou Heikuro:\NSerizawa Kotetsu:\NZorder:\NSabera:\NBarrel:\NKeyman:\NTeresa:\NPresident: \NResearcher A: \NResearcher B:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:19.33,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1248,144)}Sugao Takayuki \NKojima Toshihiko \NGenda Tessho\NTezuka Hideaki \NKaida Yuko\NTersoma Masaki \NKamiya Hiroshi\NKanda Sayaka\NMikimoto Yuji \NFujinuma Kento\NMogi Takamasa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.58,0:24:42.08,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(968,658)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.26,0:24:43.79,def2,BAREL,0,0,0,,Those who are called on by Teresa...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.79,0:24:47.96,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,You must have been suspicious about the \Nunusually fast completion of the Andromeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.96,0:24:49.52,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...re-equip the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.52,0:24:51.04,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Is this really a rebuild ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.04,0:24:52.27,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Is this alright ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.26,0:24:54.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Everyone, I need your help !
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.58,0:24:55.58,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(976,672)}Astonishing Legacy of the Cosmo Reverse
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.58,0:24:55.58,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 03
